&lt;i&gt;RANSOM: Log Pegawai Pertama.&lt;/i&gt;

58
00:04:00.065 --> 00:04:01.328
&lt;i&gt;Mengakhiri perbaikan di gabungan&lt;/i&gt;

59
00:04:01.458 --> 00:04:03.243
&lt;i&gt;Stasiun Penelitian Starfleet-Klingon,&lt;/i&gt;

60
00:04:03.417 --> 00:04:07.203
&lt;i&gt;the&lt;/i&gt; Cerritos &lt;i &gt;is menikmati sedikit downtime.&lt;/i &gt;

61
